    <string name="onboarding_title">Welcome to Widgeter 👋</string>
    <string name="onboarding_body">You get four home-screen widgets:\n\n⏰  Clock — time, date &amp; a greeting\n📝  Note — a quick note you can edit\n🔢  Counter — tap + and − to count anything\n✅  To-do — a checklist you tick off\n\nTo add one: long-press your home screen → Widgets → Widgeter.</string>
